# GitHub Repository Settings

Standard configuration for all Playtomic GitHub repositories to ensure consistency and best practices.

## Required Repository Settings

### General Settings

| Setting | Value | Reason |
|---------|-------|--------|
| **Automatically delete head branches** | ✅ Enabled | Keeps the repository clean by removing merged branches automatically |
| **Default branch** | `main` | Standardized naming convention |

### Branch Protection Rules (main branch)

| Setting | Value | Reason |
|---------|-------|--------|
| **Require a pull request before merging** | ✅ Enabled | Ensures code review |
| **Require approvals** | At least 1 | Ensures peer review |
| **Dismiss stale PR approvals** | ✅ Enabled | Re-review after new changes |
| **Require status checks to pass** | ✅ Enabled | CI must pass before merge |
| **Require branches to be up to date** | ✅ Enabled | Prevents merge conflicts |
| **Require linear history** | ✅ Enabled | Clean git history |

### Merge Settings

| Setting | Value | Reason |
|---------|-------|--------|
| **Allow squash merging** | ❌ Disabled | Use rebase for consistency |
| **Allow merge commits** | ❌ Disabled | Maintain linear history |
| **Allow rebase merging** | ✅ Enabled | One commit per PR |
| **Default to rebase merge** | ✅ Enabled | Automatic selection |

## Verification Checklist

Before considering a repository properly configured, verify:

- [ ] Default branch is `main`
- [ ] Automatically delete head branches is enabled
- [ ] Branch protection rules are configured for `main`
- [ ] Only rebase merging is allowed
- [ ] At least 1 approval is required for PRs
- [ ] Status checks are required to pass
